SwordWeave / Aegis / v0.1 alpha
Created by Marius Ion (Mashu).
Keep a copy, print for your table and share these complete free sheets with friends.
Printable pencil-and-paper PDF; no interactive form fields.
Original game text: CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Artwork, branding, fonts and icons retain their separate notices.
AI-generated illustrations: OpenAI image tools under Marius Ion's direction; rendered in grayscale.
Font notices and any used image/icon credits are attached to this PDF.
This does not grant a standalone artwork or trademark license.
https://www.swordweave.quest/books#character-sheets
https://www.swordweave.quest/contact

